meta {
  name: Space Delete Space
  type: http
  seq: 171
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.space.deleteSpace
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "space": "at:space/{{did}}/org.example.bucket/main"
  }
}

docs {
  Delete a space: the row survives as a tombstone (credential renewals answer SpaceDeleted)
  with its policy cleared; the member list, notification registrations, writer set and the
  authority's own repo go with it, and registered syncers are told to drop their copies.
  Idempotent: an already-deleted space answers 200.

  "space:…?manage=delete", authority only. Errors: 400 SpaceNotFound, 400 NotAuthorized,
  403 InsufficientScope.
}
